                  "color": "#93c5fd",
                  "name": "Lower Class",
                  "share": 15.0
                }
              ],
              "description": "The five class strata, richest to poorest, each with its starting population share (must sum to 100) and bar color. Drives the stacked bar; the mobility transition and Gini index are computed over these five shares in fixed order.",
